# The index is a build product, not source. "python lp21.py index" retrieves it
# from be.lehrplan.ch onto the local machine. Rights to that content belong to
# the Erziehungsdirektion des Kantons Bern / D-EDK, not to entrosana, so it must
# never be committed here.
index.json
ueberfachlich.json

# "python lp21.py export" writes the same corpus as Markdown. Same reason.
bestand/
export/

# The export command takes a free target name, so the two directories above are
# not enough — "lp21.py export lehrplan-md" would slip past them and carry the
# whole corpus into a commit. Everything Markdown is therefore ignored by
# default and the documented files are named back in one by one. Add any new
# documentation file here, deliberately.
*.md
!README.md
!claude/README.md
!LIESMICH.md

# Raw fetched pages. lp21.py keeps its cache outside the script directory by
# default; this catches the case where LP21_CACHE has been pointed in here.
.lp21/
*.html

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
